  "about": "The gathering spots of the non-combat skills, read by scripts/build-skilling.ts against the OSRS Wiki. A resource names its wiki object (spawns), the page with its skilling success chart, its products (XP and level from the products' info templates) and its tool; a spot names one spawn group of the object's ObjectLocLines (exact location text) and the bank players use from it (a majorLocations.json bank), or no bank (drop only). A spot under the ground names its way in (entrance: a dungeon of majorLocations.json, 6400 tiles south of the spawns). A method of trainingMethods.json lists the resources it trains. Members content is added the same way: members spawn groups are skipped on a free account by the engine, not here.",
